{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014a52GTo9syihdQGfirr2Gn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have full context. The experiment plan has two `planned` experiments (exp-014, exp-028), one `what_if` (exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated), and one `RUNNING` (exp_32b_c4). All other experiments are `DONE`. I need to generate best-tier predicted results for all planned experiments.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Best 档下，所有 planned 实验均产出支持核心叙事的结果。exp-014 在 Common Crawl 2025/2026 中\n  发现 depth 预测与 vocabulary richness 的显著负相关，提供 naturalistic validation。\n  exp-028 的 subsampling power curve 表明 n≥2000 即可稳定判定 K*=2。exp_32b_c4 在 32B \n  模型上确认 K*=2 不随规模变化。what_if exp_026 的 arXiv null result 被审稿人视为诚实科学，\n  提升论文可信度 0.5-1.0 分。整体论文以 domain-dependent bounded saturation + honest negatives \n  的组合，以 characterization study 定位获得 EMNLP Main 接收。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014 Naturalistic Validation (Common Crawl)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025-21/2026-09 snapshot 各抽 10K 文档，用训练好的 15D OBD 分类器\n      做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, hapax legomena ratio)、\n      self-BLEU 做 correlation 分析。验证 depth 预测在 wild data 上的生态效度。\n    expected_results:\n      n_docs_2025: 10000\n      n_docs_2026: 10000\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2025:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.18\n        depth_2: 0.07\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2026:\n        depth_0: 0.61\n        depth_1: 0.24\n        depth_2: 0.10\n        depth_3_plus: 0.05\n      depth_vs_ttr_spearman: -0.34\n      depth_vs_ttr_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_vs_hapax_ratio_spearman: -0.29\n      depth_vs_hapax_ratio_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_vs_alignscore_spearman: -0.18\n      depth_vs_alignscore_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_vs_self_bleu_spearman: 0.22\n      depth_vs_self_bleu_p: \"<0.001\"\n      temporal_shift_depth1_plus_pct_delta: \"+7.7pp\"\n      temporal_shift_direction: \"2026 shows higher predicted synthetic proportion\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下：(1) depth 预测与 vocabulary richness 指标（TTR, hapax ratio）呈中等负相关\n      （ρ≈-0.29 to -0.34），因为递归生成导致 vocabulary narrowing 是已知效应（Shumailov et al. 2023），\n      15D features 中的 freq_entropy 本身就捕获了这个信号，所以 depth 预测与独立 lexical diversity \n      指标的一致性是预期的。(2) AlignScore 相关性较弱（ρ≈-0.18），因为 AlignScore 测量的是事实一致性\n      而非生成深度，两者仅部分重叠——深层合成文本的事实性下降但 AlignScore 的设计目标不同。\n      (3) Self-BLEU 正相关（ρ≈0.22），因为递归生成增加重复性。(4) 2025→2026 时间趋势显示\n      合成文本占比上升约 7.7pp，与 2024-2025 年间 LLM 生成内容在 web 上指数增长的趋势一致。\n      相关性为中等强度而非强相关，因为 wild data 含有大量混淆因素（topic, length, author style），\n      但方向一致性和统计显著性足以作为 naturalistic validation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Naturalistic Correlation Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Spearman ρ\", \"p-value\", \"n\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Depth vs TTR\", \"-0.34\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n          - [\"Depth vs Hapax Ratio\", \"-0.29\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n          - [\"Depth vs AlignScore\", \"-0.18\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n          - [\"Depth vs Self-BLEU\", \"+0.22\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution Shift\"\n        columns: [\"Snapshot\", \"Depth 0\", \"Depth 1\", \"Depth 2\", \"Depth 3+\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CC 2025-21\", \"72%\", \"18%\", \"7%\", \"3%\"]\n          - [\"CC 2026-09\", \"61%\", \"24%\", \"10%\", \"5%\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"-11pp\", \"+6pp\", \"+3pp\", \"+2pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plots with regression lines for depth vs TTR and depth vs hapax ratio, colored by snapshot year. Shows consistent negative trend across both time points with 2026 shifted toward higher depths.\"\n      - \"Fig: Stacked bar chart comparing predicted depth distributions between 2025 and 2026 snapshots, visually demonstrating temporal increase in synthetic content proportion.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 确认 depth 预测在 wild data 上与独立 lexical diversity 指标方向一致，\n      中等效应量（|ρ|=0.18-0.34）在 20K 样本上高度显著。这些相关性不依赖于我们的 15D feature set 的\n      任何特定特征，而是与外部指标的独立验证。时间趋势提供了额外的 face validity。论文定位为 \n      Appendix 支持材料，不作为主线 claim 的基础，但回应了 \"lab-controlled setup 是否泛化\" 的审稿人关切。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      从 exp-007 的 C4 数据中，以 n={1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000} 五个样本量、每个做 \n      10 次随机 resampling，计算每次 resample 下的 1v2 AUC 及其 bootstrap CI，确定 K*=2 \n      判定所需最低样本量。\n    expected_results:\n      sample_sizes: [1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000]\n      resamples_per_size: 10\n      fraction_kstar_2:\n        n1000: 0.6\n        n2000: 0.9\n        n3000: 1.0\n        n4000: 1.0\n        n5000: 1.0\n      mean_1v2_auc:\n        n1000: 0.612\n        n2000: 0.617\n        n3000: 0.620\n        n4000: 0.622\n        n5000: 0.624\n      mean_ci_width:\n        n1000: 0.038\n        n2000: 0.027\n        n3000: 0.022\n        n4000: 0.019\n        n5000: 0.017\n      min_n_for_robust_kstar2: 2000\n      mean_1v2_ci_lower:\n        n1000: 0.593\n        n2000: 0.604\n        n3000: 0.609\n        n4000: 0.613\n        n5000: 0.616\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下：(1) n=1000 时 CI width≈0.038，1v2 AUC 点估计约 0.612 但 CI lower 经常\n      落到 0.593（< θ=0.60），导致仅 60% 的 resamples 判定 K*=2——统计功效不足。\n      (2) n=2000 时 CI width 缩至约 0.027，mean CI lower 升至 0.604，90% resamples 给出 K*=2。\n      这是因为 1v2 效应量本身较小（AUC≈0.62，对应 Cohen's d≈0.20），需要足够样本量才能\n      让 CI 不跨越 θ=0.60 阈值。(3) n≥3000 后 100% resamples 均判定 K*=2，因为 CI width\n      缩至 0.022 以下，即使最不利的 resample 其 CI lower 也在 0.609 以上。\n      (4) 点估计随 n 增加轻微上升（0.612→0.624），这是小样本负偏的纠正效应。\n      结论：n=2000 是 robust K*=2 判定的 practical minimum，但 n=3000 提供 100% 稳定性。\n      论文的 n=5000 设计远超 minimum required，充分回应了审稿人关于样本量的关切。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: K*=2 Determination Stability by Sample Size\"\n        columns: [\"n\", \"K*=2 fraction\", \"Mean 1v2 AUC\", \"Mean CI lower\", \"Mean CI width\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"6/10\", \"0.612\", \"0.593\", \"0.038\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"9/10\", \"0.617\", \"0.604\", \"0.027\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.620\", \"0.609\", \"0.022\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.622\", \"0.613\", \"0.019\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.624\", \"0.616\", \"0.017\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Line plot with error bands showing mean 1v2 AUC ± CI width across sample sizes. Horizontal dashed line at θ=0.60. Shows CI lower crossing θ between n=1000 and n=2000. Each resample shown as semi-transparent dot.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Power analysis 证明 n=2000 是 K*=2 判定的 practical minimum（90% 稳定），\n      n=3000 给出完全稳定性。论文的 n=5000 per condition 远超需求，\n      为 Reviewer m4 的样本量关切提供定量回应。放 Appendix 作为 robustness check。\n\n  - name: \"exp_32b_c4 Qwen2.5-32B Cross-Scale (RUNNING)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_32b_c4\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-32B continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。\n      最大规模模型验证 K*=2 的 scale invariance。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9515\n        1v2: 0.6185\n        2v3: 0.5465\n        3v4: 0.5215\n        4v5: 0.5125\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0985\n        1v2: 0.0108\n        2v3: 0.0058\n        3v4: 0.0041\n        4v5: 0.0033\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1:\n          ci_lower: 0.9478\n          ci_upper: 0.9552\n        1v2:\n          ci_lower: 0.6092\n          ci_upper: 0.6278\n        2v3:\n          ci_lower: 0.5363\n          ci_upper: 0.5567\n        3v4:\n          ci_lower: 0.5112\n          ci_upper: 0.5318\n        4v5:\n          ci_lower: 0.5018\n          ci_upper: 0.5232\n      ordinal_mae: 1.235\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.348\n      top_features:\n        - freq_entropy\n        - surp_d1_skew\n        - surp_std\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下：(1) K*=2 在 32B 模型上得到确认，1v2 CI lower=0.6092 > θ=0.60。\n      这延续了 1.5B→7B→14B→32B 的 scale invariance 趋势。(2) 0v1 AUC 略低于小模型\n      （0.9515 vs Qwen-1.5B 0.987），因为更大模型生成的文本更接近人类分布，\n      binary 信号稍弱但仍远超阈值。(3) 1v2 AUC (0.6185) 与 14B (0.621) 和 7B (0.618) \n      非常接近，证明 depth discrimination boundary 不随模型规模单调变化——DPI 理论预测\n      K* 由信息损失率决定而非模型容量。(4) JSD 和特征排序与小模型一致\n      （freq_entropy 和 surp_d1_skew 仍为 top discriminators），进一步支持 \n      K* 是文本固有属性而非模型属性的核心论点。(5) 32B 是论文中最大的模型，\n      虽仍属 ≤32B 范围（不覆盖 70B+），但已将 scale invariance 证据链从 \"≤8B\" \n      扩展至 \"≤32B\"，显著缓解审稿人关于模型规模局限性的关切。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scale Invariance Summary (C4, continuation, θ=0.60)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Scale\", \"K*\", \"1v2 AUC\", \"1v2 CI lower\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OLMo\", \"1B\", \"2\", \"0.6145\", \"0.6045\"]\n          - [\"Pythia\", \"1.4B\", \"2\", \"0.6539\", \"0.6454\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", \"1.5B\", \"2\", \"0.6262\", \"0.6168\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-instruct\", \"1.5B\", \"2\", \"0.6112\", \"0.6015\"]\n          - [\"Qwen\", \"7B\", \"2\", \"0.6178\", \"0.6079\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-3.1\", \"8B\", \"2\", \"0.6123\", \"0.6028\"]\n          - [\"Qwen\", \"14B\", \"2\", \"0.6210\", \"0.6119\"]\n          - [\"Qwen\", \"32B\", \"2\", \"0.6185\", \"0.6092\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: K* vs model scale (log scale x-axis), showing flat K*=2 line from 1B to 32B with individual 1v2 AUC values and CI error bars. Demonstrates scale invariance visually.\"\n    analysis: >\n      32B 结果将 scale invariance 证据从 ≤8B 扩展至 ≤32B，覆盖 32x 的规模范围。\n      K*=2 在所有 8 个 C4 web text 配置（含 Mistral K*=1 例外）上保持一致。\n      论文 limitation 从 \"≤8B\" 改为 \"≤32B\"，并保留 \"extending to 70B+ is future work\" \n      的措辞。审稿人关于规模局限性的关切从 moderate concern 降为 minor concern。\n\n  - name: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated (what_if: honest negative)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 的负向结果整合入论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null result \n      table，Discussion 增加 \"K* characterizes signal discriminability, not data utility\" 洞察。\n      评估 honest negative 对审稿分数和论文可信度的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      section5_arXiv_null_table:\n        strategies: [\"no_filter\", \"binary\", \"graduated_α0.9\"]\n        mmlu:\n          no_filter: \"0.5899±0.0008\"\n          binary: \"0.5876±0.0004\"\n          graduated: \"0.5900±0.0011\"\n        hellaswag:\n          no_filter: \"0.6600±0.0002\"\n          binary: \"0.6642±0.0004\"\n          graduated: \"0.6599±0.0003\"\n        paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter:\n          mmlu_p: 0.89\n          hellaswag_p: 0.71\n        verdict: \"graduated ≈ no_filter (all p > 0.24)\"\n      exp025_pythia_null_appendix:\n        delta_max: 0.0017\n        verdict: \"all strategies within noise\"\n      discussion_insight: >\n        K* characterizes the information-theoretic boundary of depth signal \n        discriminability, not the boundary of training data utility. Depth 2-3 \n        arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (K*=3) but removing it does \n        not improve downstream performance — the discriminable signal does not \n        correspond to quality degradation at these depths.\n      credibility_boost_estimated: 0.75\n      reviewer_response_predicted:\n        positive_framing: >\n          \"The authors commendably report negative results on graduated filtering \n          (exp-026) and cross-model filtering (exp-025), providing a nuanced picture \n          that strengthens the paper's scientific contribution.\"\n        c3_acceptance_shift: \"+0.10 (from 0.70 to 0.80)\"\n        soundness_boost: \"+0.25 (honest methodology)\"\n      impact_on_scores:\n        avg_reviewer_score_delta: \"+0.15\"\n        soundness_delta: \"+0.25\"\n        substance_delta: \"+0.10\"\n        venue_acceptance_prob_delta: \"+0.05\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下，honest negatives 产生显著的可信度提升效应：\n      (1) exp-026 arXiv null result 被审稿人视为负责任的科学态度。在 ML 领域，报告负向结果\n      仍然稀缺，这种做法本身就是差异化信号。审稿人对 C3 的接受度从 0.70 升至 0.80，\n      因为 C3 的 claim 从 \"graduated filtering is universally better\" 调整为更精确的 \n      \"binary K*-aware filtering is the appropriate granularity for web text (K*=2); \n      on domains with higher K* (arXiv, K*=3), the additional depth information \n      does not translate to downstream utility gains\"——这是一个更有 nuance 也更可信的叙事。\n      (2) Discussion 中的 \"K* ≠ data utility\" 洞察被审稿人视为 conceptual contribution，\n      因为它区分了信息论意义上的可区分性和实际训练价值——这是一个非显然但重要的观察，\n      为 K* 的理论定位提供了更精确的边界。(3) exp-025 Pythia null 放 Appendix 作为 \n      model-scale sensitivity 分析，审稿人注意到但不视为主线缺陷，因为 Pythia-1.4B \n      在 MMLU 上的 base performance (0.2568) 本身就接近 random，filtering 效果被 \n      model capacity floor 掩盖是合理的解释。(4) 综合影响：honest negatives 将论文\n      从 \"we prove everything works\" 的可疑叙事转为 \"we carefully characterize what works \n      and what doesn't\"，这在 characterization study 的定位下尤其有效。预估 soundness \n      提升 0.25 分（从 3.5-4.0 范围的下端移向上端），整体接收概率提升约 5pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (Section 5): arXiv Domain Filtering — Null Result\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"Δ MMLU vs no-filter\", \"Δ HellaSwag vs no-filter\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No filter\", \"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.6600±0.0002\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Binary (K*-aware)\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"-0.0023*\", \"+0.0042***\"]\n          - [\"Graduated (α=0.9)\", \"0.5900±0.0011\", \"0.6599±0.0003\", \"+0.0001\", \"-0.0001\"]\n        footnotes:\n          - \"* p=0.005 (paired t-test, 5 seeds); *** p<0.00001\"\n          - \"Graduated ≈ no-filter on both metrics (MMLU p=0.89, HellaSwag p=0.71)\"\n      - name: \"Table (Appendix): Pythia-1.4B Filtering — Model-Scale Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No filter\", \"0.2568±0.0012\", \"0.5250±0.0008\"]\n          - [\"Binary\", \"0.2585±0.0004\", \"0.5251±0.0001\"]\n          - [\"Graduated (α=0.9)\", \"0.2561±0.0009\", \"0.5253±0.0007\"]\n        footnotes:\n          - \"All deltas within noise (max Δ=0.0017). Pythia-1.4B MMLU baseline near random (0.257), suggesting model capacity floor masks filtering effects.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"No additional figures. The null result tables are presented as compact inline tables in Section 5 and Appendix respectively, consistent with honest-reporting style.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Honest negative integration 是 best 档的关键差异化因素。审稿人在 best 档下不仅\n      不惩罚负向结果，反而给予可信度加分。核心机制：(1) C3 claim 的精确化——从 \n      over-broad \"K* predicts optimal curation\" 到 nuanced \"K* predicts discriminability \n      boundary; curation utility depends on domain-specific quality-depth coupling\"；\n      (2) 概念贡献的增加——\"K* ≠ data utility\" 成为 Discussion 的独立贡献点；\n      (3) 论文完整性——读者不需要猜测 \"graduated filtering 在其他域是否有效\"，\n      因为论文已经系统测试并报告了答案。这种透明度在 EMNLP 审稿文化中尤其受重视。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":156,"cache_read_input_tokens":62509,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":156},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a5d1ea3f-8346-4cc0-9ac0-55186f6bd130","uuid":"5eedeabe-a792-49cd-9161-4b6612601dc3"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":141148,"duration_api_ms":143176,"num_turns":3,"result":"Now I have full context. The experiment plan has two `planned` experiments (exp-014, exp-028), one `what_if` (exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated), and one `RUNNING` (exp_32b_c4). All other experiments are `DONE`. I need to generate best-tier predicted results for all planned experiments.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Best 档下，所有 planned 实验均产出支持核心叙事的结果。exp-014 在 Common Crawl 2025/2026 中\n  发现 depth 预测与 vocabulary richness 的显著负相关，提供 naturalistic validation。\n  exp-028 的 subsampling power curve 表明 n≥2000 即可稳定判定 K*=2。exp_32b_c4 在 32B \n  模型上确认 K*=2 不随规模变化。what_if exp_026 的 arXiv null result 被审稿人视为诚实科学，\n  提升论文可信度 0.5-1.0 分。整体论文以 domain-dependent bounded saturation + honest negatives \n  的组合，以 characterization study 定位获得 EMNLP Main 接收。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"exp-014 Naturalistic Validation (Common Crawl)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: >\n      对 Common Crawl 2025-21/2026-09 snapshot 各抽 10K 文档，用训练好的 15D OBD 分类器\n      做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness (type-token ratio, hapax legomena ratio)、\n      self-BLEU 做 correlation 分析。验证 depth 预测在 wild data 上的生态效度。\n    expected_results:\n      n_docs_2025: 10000\n      n_docs_2026: 10000\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2025:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.18\n        depth_2: 0.07\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      predicted_depth_distribution_2026:\n        depth_0: 0.61\n        depth_1: 0.24\n        depth_2: 0.10\n        depth_3_plus: 0.05\n      depth_vs_ttr_spearman: -0.34\n      depth_vs_ttr_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_vs_hapax_ratio_spearman: -0.29\n      depth_vs_hapax_ratio_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_vs_alignscore_spearman: -0.18\n      depth_vs_alignscore_p: \"<0.001\"\n      depth_vs_self_bleu_spearman: 0.22\n      depth_vs_self_bleu_p: \"<0.001\"\n      temporal_shift_depth1_plus_pct_delta: \"+7.7pp\"\n      temporal_shift_direction: \"2026 shows higher predicted synthetic proportion\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下：(1) depth 预测与 vocabulary richness 指标（TTR, hapax ratio）呈中等负相关\n      （ρ≈-0.29 to -0.34），因为递归生成导致 vocabulary narrowing 是已知效应（Shumailov et al. 2023），\n      15D features 中的 freq_entropy 本身就捕获了这个信号，所以 depth 预测与独立 lexical diversity \n      指标的一致性是预期的。(2) AlignScore 相关性较弱（ρ≈-0.18），因为 AlignScore 测量的是事实一致性\n      而非生成深度，两者仅部分重叠——深层合成文本的事实性下降但 AlignScore 的设计目标不同。\n      (3) Self-BLEU 正相关（ρ≈0.22），因为递归生成增加重复性。(4) 2025→2026 时间趋势显示\n      合成文本占比上升约 7.7pp，与 2024-2025 年间 LLM 生成内容在 web 上指数增长的趋势一致。\n      相关性为中等强度而非强相关，因为 wild data 含有大量混淆因素（topic, length, author style），\n      但方向一致性和统计显著性足以作为 naturalistic validation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Naturalistic Correlation Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Spearman ρ\", \"p-value\", \"n\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Depth vs TTR\", \"-0.34\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n          - [\"Depth vs Hapax Ratio\", \"-0.29\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n          - [\"Depth vs AlignScore\", \"-0.18\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n          - [\"Depth vs Self-BLEU\", \"+0.22\", \"<0.001\", \"20000\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Predicted Depth Distribution Shift\"\n        columns: [\"Snapshot\", \"Depth 0\", \"Depth 1\", \"Depth 2\", \"Depth 3+\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CC 2025-21\", \"72%\", \"18%\", \"7%\", \"3%\"]\n          - [\"CC 2026-09\", \"61%\", \"24%\", \"10%\", \"5%\"]\n          - [\"Δ\", \"-11pp\", \"+6pp\", \"+3pp\", \"+2pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plots with regression lines for depth vs TTR and depth vs hapax ratio, colored by snapshot year. Shows consistent negative trend across both time points with 2026 shifted toward higher depths.\"\n      - \"Fig: Stacked bar chart comparing predicted depth distributions between 2025 and 2026 snapshots, visually demonstrating temporal increase in synthetic content proportion.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Naturalistic validation 确认 depth 预测在 wild data 上与独立 lexical diversity 指标方向一致，\n      中等效应量（|ρ|=0.18-0.34）在 20K 样本上高度显著。这些相关性不依赖于我们的 15D feature set 的\n      任何特定特征，而是与外部指标的独立验证。时间趋势提供了额外的 face validity。论文定位为 \n      Appendix 支持材料，不作为主线 claim 的基础，但回应了 \"lab-controlled setup 是否泛化\" 的审稿人关切。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028 Subsampling Power Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-028\"\n    description: >\n      从 exp-007 的 C4 数据中，以 n={1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000} 五个样本量、每个做 \n      10 次随机 resampling，计算每次 resample 下的 1v2 AUC 及其 bootstrap CI，确定 K*=2 \n      判定所需最低样本量。\n    expected_results:\n      sample_sizes: [1000, 2000, 3000, 4000, 5000]\n      resamples_per_size: 10\n      fraction_kstar_2:\n        n1000: 0.6\n        n2000: 0.9\n        n3000: 1.0\n        n4000: 1.0\n        n5000: 1.0\n      mean_1v2_auc:\n        n1000: 0.612\n        n2000: 0.617\n        n3000: 0.620\n        n4000: 0.622\n        n5000: 0.624\n      mean_ci_width:\n        n1000: 0.038\n        n2000: 0.027\n        n3000: 0.022\n        n4000: 0.019\n        n5000: 0.017\n      min_n_for_robust_kstar2: 2000\n      mean_1v2_ci_lower:\n        n1000: 0.593\n        n2000: 0.604\n        n3000: 0.609\n        n4000: 0.613\n        n5000: 0.616\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下：(1) n=1000 时 CI width≈0.038，1v2 AUC 点估计约 0.612 但 CI lower 经常\n      落到 0.593（< θ=0.60），导致仅 60% 的 resamples 判定 K*=2——统计功效不足。\n      (2) n=2000 时 CI width 缩至约 0.027，mean CI lower 升至 0.604，90% resamples 给出 K*=2。\n      这是因为 1v2 效应量本身较小（AUC≈0.62，对应 Cohen's d≈0.20），需要足够样本量才能\n      让 CI 不跨越 θ=0.60 阈值。(3) n≥3000 后 100% resamples 均判定 K*=2，因为 CI width\n      缩至 0.022 以下，即使最不利的 resample 其 CI lower 也在 0.609 以上。\n      (4) 点估计随 n 增加轻微上升（0.612→0.624），这是小样本负偏的纠正效应。\n      结论：n=2000 是 robust K*=2 判定的 practical minimum，但 n=3000 提供 100% 稳定性。\n      论文的 n=5000 设计远超 minimum required，充分回应了审稿人关于样本量的关切。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: K*=2 Determination Stability by Sample Size\"\n        columns: [\"n\", \"K*=2 fraction\", \"Mean 1v2 AUC\", \"Mean CI lower\", \"Mean CI width\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1,000\", \"6/10\", \"0.612\", \"0.593\", \"0.038\"]\n          - [\"2,000\", \"9/10\", \"0.617\", \"0.604\", \"0.027\"]\n          - [\"3,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.620\", \"0.609\", \"0.022\"]\n          - [\"4,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.622\", \"0.613\", \"0.019\"]\n          - [\"5,000\", \"10/10\", \"0.624\", \"0.616\", \"0.017\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Line plot with error bands showing mean 1v2 AUC ± CI width across sample sizes. Horizontal dashed line at θ=0.60. Shows CI lower crossing θ between n=1000 and n=2000. Each resample shown as semi-transparent dot.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Power analysis 证明 n=2000 是 K*=2 判定的 practical minimum（90% 稳定），\n      n=3000 给出完全稳定性。论文的 n=5000 per condition 远超需求，\n      为 Reviewer m4 的样本量关切提供定量回应。放 Appendix 作为 robustness check。\n\n  - name: \"exp_32b_c4 Qwen2.5-32B Cross-Scale (RUNNING)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_32b_c4\"\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-32B continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B。\n      最大规模模型验证 K*=2 的 scale invariance。\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9515\n        1v2: 0.6185\n        2v3: 0.5465\n        3v4: 0.5215\n        4v5: 0.5125\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.0985\n        1v2: 0.0108\n        2v3: 0.0058\n        3v4: 0.0041\n        4v5: 0.0033\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1:\n          ci_lower: 0.9478\n          ci_upper: 0.9552\n        1v2:\n          ci_lower: 0.6092\n          ci_upper: 0.6278\n        2v3:\n          ci_lower: 0.5363\n          ci_upper: 0.5567\n        3v4:\n          ci_lower: 0.5112\n          ci_upper: 0.5318\n        4v5:\n          ci_lower: 0.5018\n          ci_upper: 0.5232\n      ordinal_mae: 1.235\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.348\n      top_features:\n        - freq_entropy\n        - surp_d1_skew\n        - surp_std\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下：(1) K*=2 在 32B 模型上得到确认，1v2 CI lower=0.6092 > θ=0.60。\n      这延续了 1.5B→7B→14B→32B 的 scale invariance 趋势。(2) 0v1 AUC 略低于小模型\n      （0.9515 vs Qwen-1.5B 0.987），因为更大模型生成的文本更接近人类分布，\n      binary 信号稍弱但仍远超阈值。(3) 1v2 AUC (0.6185) 与 14B (0.621) 和 7B (0.618) \n      非常接近，证明 depth discrimination boundary 不随模型规模单调变化——DPI 理论预测\n      K* 由信息损失率决定而非模型容量。(4) JSD 和特征排序与小模型一致\n      （freq_entropy 和 surp_d1_skew 仍为 top discriminators），进一步支持 \n      K* 是文本固有属性而非模型属性的核心论点。(5) 32B 是论文中最大的模型，\n      虽仍属 ≤32B 范围（不覆盖 70B+），但已将 scale invariance 证据链从 \"≤8B\" \n      扩展至 \"≤32B\"，显著缓解审稿人关于模型规模局限性的关切。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scale Invariance Summary (C4, continuation, θ=0.60)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Scale\", \"K*\", \"1v2 AUC\", \"1v2 CI lower\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OLMo\", \"1B\", \"2\", \"0.6145\", \"0.6045\"]\n          - [\"Pythia\", \"1.4B\", \"2\", \"0.6539\", \"0.6454\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-base\", \"1.5B\", \"2\", \"0.6262\", \"0.6168\"]\n          - [\"Qwen-instruct\", \"1.5B\", \"2\", \"0.6112\", \"0.6015\"]\n          - [\"Qwen\", \"7B\", \"2\", \"0.6178\", \"0.6079\"]\n          - [\"LLaMA-3.1\", \"8B\", \"2\", \"0.6123\", \"0.6028\"]\n          - [\"Qwen\", \"14B\", \"2\", \"0.6210\", \"0.6119\"]\n          - [\"Qwen\", \"32B\", \"2\", \"0.6185\", \"0.6092\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: K* vs model scale (log scale x-axis), showing flat K*=2 line from 1B to 32B with individual 1v2 AUC values and CI error bars. Demonstrates scale invariance visually.\"\n    analysis: >\n      32B 结果将 scale invariance 证据从 ≤8B 扩展至 ≤32B，覆盖 32x 的规模范围。\n      K*=2 在所有 8 个 C4 web text 配置（含 Mistral K*=1 例外）上保持一致。\n      论文 limitation 从 \"≤8B\" 改为 \"≤32B\"，并保留 \"extending to 70B+ is future work\" \n      的措辞。审稿人关于规模局限性的关切从 moderate concern 降为 minor concern。\n\n  - name: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated (what_if: honest negative)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\"\n    description: >\n      将 exp-026 arXiv graduated filtering 的负向结果整合入论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null result \n      table，Discussion 增加 \"K* characterizes signal discriminability, not data utility\" 洞察。\n      评估 honest negative 对审稿分数和论文可信度的影响。\n    expected_results:\n      section5_arXiv_null_table:\n        strategies: [\"no_filter\", \"binary\", \"graduated_α0.9\"]\n        mmlu:\n          no_filter: \"0.5899±0.0008\"\n          binary: \"0.5876±0.0004\"\n          graduated: \"0.5900±0.0011\"\n        hellaswag:\n          no_filter: \"0.6600±0.0002\"\n          binary: \"0.6642±0.0004\"\n          graduated: \"0.6599±0.0003\"\n        paired_ttest_graduated_vs_nofilter:\n          mmlu_p: 0.89\n          hellaswag_p: 0.71\n        verdict: \"graduated ≈ no_filter (all p > 0.24)\"\n      exp025_pythia_null_appendix:\n        delta_max: 0.0017\n        verdict: \"all strategies within noise\"\n      discussion_insight: >\n        K* characterizes the information-theoretic boundary of depth signal \n        discriminability, not the boundary of training data utility. Depth 2-3 \n        arXiv text is statistically distinguishable (K*=3) but removing it does \n        not improve downstream performance — the discriminable signal does not \n        correspond to quality degradation at these depths.\n      credibility_boost_estimated: 0.75\n      reviewer_response_predicted:\n        positive_framing: >\n          \"The authors commendably report negative results on graduated filtering \n          (exp-026) and cross-model filtering (exp-025), providing a nuanced picture \n          that strengthens the paper's scientific contribution.\"\n        c3_acceptance_shift: \"+0.10 (from 0.70 to 0.80)\"\n        soundness_boost: \"+0.25 (honest methodology)\"\n      impact_on_scores:\n        avg_reviewer_score_delta: \"+0.15\"\n        soundness_delta: \"+0.25\"\n        substance_delta: \"+0.10\"\n        venue_acceptance_prob_delta: \"+0.05\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下，honest negatives 产生显著的可信度提升效应：\n      (1) exp-026 arXiv null result 被审稿人视为负责任的科学态度。在 ML 领域，报告负向结果\n      仍然稀缺，这种做法本身就是差异化信号。审稿人对 C3 的接受度从 0.70 升至 0.80，\n      因为 C3 的 claim 从 \"graduated filtering is universally better\" 调整为更精确的 \n      \"binary K*-aware filtering is the appropriate granularity for web text (K*=2); \n      on domains with higher K* (arXiv, K*=3), the additional depth information \n      does not translate to downstream utility gains\"——这是一个更有 nuance 也更可信的叙事。\n      (2) Discussion 中的 \"K* ≠ data utility\" 洞察被审稿人视为 conceptual contribution，\n      因为它区分了信息论意义上的可区分性和实际训练价值——这是一个非显然但重要的观察，\n      为 K* 的理论定位提供了更精确的边界。(3) exp-025 Pythia null 放 Appendix 作为 \n      model-scale sensitivity 分析，审稿人注意到但不视为主线缺陷，因为 Pythia-1.4B \n      在 MMLU 上的 base performance (0.2568) 本身就接近 random，filtering 效果被 \n      model capacity floor 掩盖是合理的解释。(4) 综合影响：honest negatives 将论文\n      从 \"we prove everything works\" 的可疑叙事转为 \"we carefully characterize what works \n      and what doesn't\"，这在 characterization study 的定位下尤其有效。预估 soundness \n      提升 0.25 分（从 3.5-4.0 范围的下端移向上端），整体接收概率提升约 5pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table (Section 5): arXiv Domain Filtering — Null Result\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"Δ MMLU vs no-filter\", \"Δ HellaSwag vs no-filter\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No filter\", \"0.5899±0.0008\", \"0.6600±0.0002\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Binary (K*-aware)\", \"0.5876±0.0004\", \"0.6642±0.0004\", \"-0.0023*\", \"+0.0042***\"]\n          - [\"Graduated (α=0.9)\", \"0.5900±0.0011\", \"0.6599±0.0003\", \"+0.0001\", \"-0.0001\"]\n        footnotes:\n          - \"* p=0.005 (paired t-test, 5 seeds); *** p<0.00001\"\n          - \"Graduated ≈ no-filter on both metrics (MMLU p=0.89, HellaSwag p=0.71)\"\n      - name: \"Table (Appendix): Pythia-1.4B Filtering — Model-Scale Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No filter\", \"0.2568±0.0012\", \"0.5250±0.0008\"]\n          - [\"Binary\", \"0.2585±0.0004\", \"0.5251±0.0001\"]\n          - [\"Graduated (α=0.9)\", \"0.2561±0.0009\", \"0.5253±0.0007\"]\n        footnotes:\n          - \"All deltas within noise (max Δ=0.0017). Pythia-1.4B MMLU baseline near random (0.257), suggesting model capacity floor masks filtering effects.\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"No additional figures. The null result tables are presented as compact inline tables in Section 5 and Appendix respectively, consistent with honest-reporting style.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Honest negative integration 是 best 档的关键差异化因素。审稿人在 best 档下不仅\n      不惩罚负向结果，反而给予可信度加分。核心机制：(1) C3 claim 的精确化——从 \n      over-broad \"K* predicts optimal curation\" 到 nuanced \"K* predicts discriminability \n      boundary; curation utility depends on domain-specific quality-depth coupling\"；\n      (2) 概念贡献的增加——\"K* ≠ data utility\" 成为 Discussion 的独立贡献点；\n      (3) 论文完整性——读者不需要猜测 \"graduated filtering 在其他域是否有效\"，\n      因为论文已经系统测试并报告了答案。这种透明度在 EMNLP 审稿文化中尤其受重视。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a5d1ea3f-8346-4cc0-9ac0-55186f6bd130","total_cost_usd":0.5978985,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":50824,"cache_read_input_tokens":135813,"output_tokens":6703,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":50824,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":6403,"cache_read_input_tokens":62509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":156,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":156},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":44582,"outputTokens":33,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.044746999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":6703,"cacheReadInputTokens":135813,"cacheCreationInputTokens":50824,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5531515,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"46d0878d-fcb3-45f0-8e58-411505f7660b"}
